  "description": "Operating Area: Indonesia\n\nLaunching in 2026, Otium is a 48-meter phinisi that unites Indonesian craftsmanship with modern design, creating an ambiance of quiet elegance and comfort.\n\nEach of Otium’s six cabins is a private retreat, from panoramic suites to bright, airy staterooms thoughtfully finished with handcrafted details that go beyond the ordinary. Natural materials, soft tones, and refined touches shape interiors that feel warm, intimate, and timeless.\n\nSailing through Komodo’s golden isles, Alor’s hidden shores, the Spice Islands, and Raja Ampat’s coral gardens, Otium invites you to discover Indonesia’s most beautiful seas with grace and ease.\n\nThis is Otium — your second home at sea.",
